{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/gameplay-intro.gif?t=1745581598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kabonk! is a nostalgic brick-breaker with multilevel puzzles, physic based controls and a sweet set of power ups set in neon-lit arcades. Enter the arcade and experience a classic with sparks, bounces and bonks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/gameplay-header.gif?t=1745581598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Kabonk! you control a physics based paddle and navigate through multiple arcade levels by breaking bricks with different types of spheres, each with unique physics-based properties. Try smashing difficult bricks with more force or add spin-effects to reach difficult objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628790/extras/features-header.gif?t=1745581598\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some bricks are unbreakable but some just needs some force or extra love. Manipulate your way through each level and try to beat each puzzle.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5+ different worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25+ unique levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Physics based manipulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10+ power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Coming soon) Steam leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Neon-lit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Switches, buttons and pressure plates</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*All images are captured early in development and are subject to change.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628790?t=1745581598","background_r